  "details": "I suggest to not count Animator on root (where AvatarDescriptor is set) GameObject. \nThat's because for now with only using root Animator it's only posible to customize animations by overriding pre-defined movement-based animations. You can not add standalone or custom animation using this. Only way to add extra animations is to use at least one extra Animator. If goal is to minimize number of Animators it's possible to attach another animator on Armature GameObject and put all animations and state machines into that.",
